      "writtenOn": "2024-07-31T08:04:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Before setting up a flag with this namespace, can you check that you are able to successfully configure multiple namespaces associated with the tethering module (http://shortn/_dElvtDN6XN, http://shortn/_yWwq7SMTgL) ? In the past I think we\u0027ve hit some presubmit problems as this isn\u0027t a configuration that is often tested.\n\nOne namespace shouldn\u0027t be across several modules with the current infra, but theoretically one module can cover several namespaces.\n\nThis association allows the on-device watchdog to know that on rollback of the module it should clear associated flags, to go back to a clean state.\n\nI think it would be OK to use the tethering namespace (DeviceConfigUtils.isTetheringFeatureEnabled) for this flag for now while you\u0027re confirming that.",
